[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1230","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1230.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1022","title":"SGI IRIX serial_ports 程序 PATH 环境变量信任本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 4.x 与 5.x 系统中的 serial_ports 管理程序在运行时信任用户自定义的 PATH 环境变量来查找并执行 ls 程序，未做路径校验。本地已登录的低权限用户可在 PATH 中植入伪造的特制 ls 程序（特洛伊木马），当 serial_ports 以 root 权限调用 ls 时便会执行该恶意程序，从而提升至 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 4.x 及 5.2/5.3 等版本，攻击需本地账户访问权限，利用门槛低、危害为本地提权。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1022"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1994-10-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:32Z","remediation":"建议升级到已修复该问题的 SGI IRIX 6.2 或更高版本，并安装 SGI 官方安全补丁（如 1999 年发布的相应补丁集）。在无法立即升级时，应以 root 身份将 serial_ports 程序中的 ls 调用路径改为绝对路径 /bin/ls，并收紧该程序 setuid 权限或限制普通用户执行权限，同时检查并清理用户环境中可疑的 PATH 值与伪造的 ls 程序作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/930","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/464","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2111","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19351","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7e65fa522cff0172990568230ff9b719b8650296/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1022.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1022","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1022.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7aedbd0209e609a1924ad29a8dda684737576137/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1022.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5d945305f2cad48b7bb06af582393a58c31555d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-29g7-m78g-3fx6/GHSA-29g7-m78g-3fx6.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1310.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000058.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1022.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1230.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1419","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1419.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1238","title":"HP HP-UX CORE-DIAG Fileset 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 9.05 及之前版本的 CORE-DIAG 文件集中的 HP message catalog 存在权限管理缺陷，本地攻击者可通过利用该组件对消息目录文件的不当权限配置，获取超出自身授权范围的系统权限，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 9.05 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1238"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1994-09-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:00Z","remediation":"升级 HP-UX 至 10.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，以 root 身份执行 `swmodify -x fileset_only=false CORE-DIAG` 移除该 fileset，或通过 `chmod 700 /usr/sbin/diag/` 限制 CORE-DIAG 目录仅 root 可访问以降低本地非授权用户利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/1531","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2262"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1419.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1257","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1257.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1219","title":"SGI IRIX sgihelp 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 5.2 及更早版本的帮助系统组件 sgihelp 中存在权限验证缺陷，本地攻击者可通过 clogin 命令利用该漏洞提升至 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 5.1/5.2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需要拥有本地访问权限方可利用，成功利用后可完全控制受影响的系统。Exploit-DB 已公开该漏洞的利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1219"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1994-08-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:58Z","remediation":"SGI IRIX 已停止维护，建议立即迁移至受支持的操作系统（如 Linux）。如无法迁移，可限制本地用户对 sgihelp 和 clogin 命令的执行权限，移除 setuid 位：chmod u-s /usr/sbin/sgihelp，并移除不必要的本地用户账户以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/e-33.shtml","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1994-13.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/468","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/511","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19354","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1219.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1219","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1219.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1219.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-66gj-m4p3-m782/GHSA-66gj-m4p3-m782.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/468/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1219.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000055.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--29102abf-cbfc-4c27-9009-657d6b974762.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1257.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1257.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1286","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1286.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1494","title":"SGI IRIX colorview 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 操作系统中的 colorview 工具存在任意文件读取漏洞。由于 colorview 在处理 -text 参数时未对用户指定的文件路径进行充分校验，本地攻击者可通过向 colorview 传递特制的 -text 参数读取系统上任意文件，包括敏感配置文件。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 5.1、5.2 及 6.0.1 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1494"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1994-08-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:33Z","remediation":"建议立即应用 SGI 于 1995 年发布的安全公告 19950209-01-P 中的官方补丁（ftp://patches.sgi.com/support/free/security/advisories/19950209-01-P）。如无法安装补丁，可移除 colorview 的 setuid/setgid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/colorview）并严格限制可执行该命令的用户范围。由于 SGI IRIX 已停止支持多年，建议将业务迁移至仍受支持的操作系统平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/675","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/336","http://www.tryc.on.ca/archives/bugtraq/1995_1/0614.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2112","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19269","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b172e0393d29bddb2ceeda5ce57e29123589a55b/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1494.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1494","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1494.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9a5386d000a40888283d918a46b8928ffcbfca7b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1494.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fe37e86b4ab6d44c1acc95d76e30f97043bfd67f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-g63x-c8p3-9qvj/GHSA-g63x-c8p3-9qvj.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/1999.tsv","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fe8f4b10-c071-4506-b8ca-39141108af35.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1494.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1286.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1286.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1286.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1559","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1559.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1552","title":"IBM AIX dpsexec 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 3.2.5 及更早版本中，当 XDM 环境下运行 dpsexec（DPS Server）时，存在权限检查不严的安全漏洞。本地攻击者可利用该程序未正确校验权限的缺陷，通过构造特制请求覆盖系统任意文件，进而实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 AIX 3.x 系列操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，无需远程网络连接即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1552"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1994-07-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:42Z","remediation":"升级 IBM AIX 至 4.0 或更高版本。如无法升级，立即移除 dpsexec 可执行文件的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/dpsexec），并将 XDM 的未授权用户执行权限收窄至仅允许受信用户组访问，同时监控本地用户对 dpsexec 的调用日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.insecure.org/lists/bugtraq/1994/Jul/0038.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/358","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cb31df1745cb795b327f3818ad29a4b3cf1cd125/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1552.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1552","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1552.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1552.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8gvm-3v25-425g/GHSA-8gvm-3v25-425g.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/358/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1552.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000053.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--03f50abf-20eb-4295-8943-9b60b3c80992.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1559.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1420","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1420.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1239","title":"HP HP-UX Xauthority 本地授权绕过漏洞","description":"HP-UX 9.x 操作系统的 Xauthority 认证机制在特定条件下未能正确启用，导致本地用户即使未经显式授权也能访问 X 显示服务。该漏洞源于 X11 窗口系统的权限控制缺陷，攻击者只需拥有本地系统访问权限即可利用，无需特殊权限。成功利用后可获取其他用户的 X 显示内容，造成敏感信息泄露。HP 已发布相关安全公告修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1239"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1994-07-13T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 HP-UX 系统至 10.x 及以上版本，该版本完整支持 Xauthority 认证机制。如无法升级，可通过编辑 /etc/dt/config/Xservers 文件启用访问控制（加上 -nolisten tcp 参数），并使用 xhost 限制仅授权用户可访问 X 显示。同时确保用户主目录下的 .Xauthority 文件权限为 600。建议迁移至受支持的操作系统版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/1559","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2261"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1420.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0393","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0393.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0207","title":"Majordomo 邮件列表管理 lists 命令远程执行漏洞","description":"Majordomo 1.89/1.90 及更早版本存在命令执行漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向邮件列表服务器发送特制邮件，在 Reply-To 字段中嵌入恶意 \"lists\" 命令参数，利用该漏洞在目标系统上以邮件服务器进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响广泛部署的 Majordomo 邮件列表管理软件，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0207"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"1994-06-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Majordomo 至 1.94 或更高版本，该版本已修复通过 Reply-To 字段注入 lists 命令参数的远程命令执行漏洞。若无法升级，应在 wrappers 配置中限制 lists 命令执行权限，并严格过滤邮件头中特殊字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0207","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20597"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0393.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0393.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0556","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0556.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0337","title":"IBM AIX batch queue (bsh) 本地和远程权限提升漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 操作系统的批处理队列（bsh）存在权限提升漏洞。当网络打印服务启用时，本地或远程攻击者可通过向批处理队列提交特制任务，利用不充分的权限控制机制获取超出授权的系统访问权限，导致攻击者能够执行任意命令或操作。该漏洞影响早期版本的 AIX 系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0337"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1994-06-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:10Z","remediation":"立即安装 IBM 针对 AIX batch queue (bsh) 的安全补丁，升级到 AIX 4.3.3 及更高修复版本。如无法打补丁，可通过 `chsubserver -r bsh` 禁用 bsh 网络打印服务，或在 `/etc/security/user` 中限制 bsh 可执行权限仅为 root 用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0337","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b8581edcbd9fb1606112c43470d0a7cb92a751f8/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0337.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0337","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0337.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0fec8c5c64ee33c93da01ddd0b28bf8f9f743a61/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0337.json","https://github.com/stg-tud/cveenhance/blob/6476e73d87cdc9cf610342ef15d131432ab41588/Annotations/Wollny/CVE-1999-0337.xml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3f4ce19e2c9952be92df5da9390e93383644298b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r76x-g7v4-r3c6/GHSA-r76x-g7v4-r3c6.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0337.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000050.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6dd5b793-7342-42d5-867d-37abc515d322.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0556.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0660","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0660.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0423","title":"HP HP-UX hpterm 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 10.20 系统中的 hpterm 终端模拟器存在权限提升漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 hpterm 发送特制请求利用该漏洞，从而获取额外的系统权限。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地访问权限，利用条件相对有限，影响 HP-UX 10.20 系统，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。建议升级到不受影响的版本或应用厂商发布的安全补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0423"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1994-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:21Z","remediation":"建议升级至 HP-UX 11.0 及以上版本，或安装 HP 发布的 PHSS_19011 补丁。如无法升级，执行 `chmod 755 /usr/bin/hpterm` 移除 hpterm 的 setuid 位，或通过 `chmod 0` 禁用该程序作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9903-093"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0660.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0256","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0256.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0113","title":"IBM AIX rlogin 权限提升漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 3.2.5 的 rlogin 实现中存在参数注入漏洞（CWE-88），当向 rlogin 命令传入 `-froot` 参数时，未经授权的本地攻击者可利用该参数绕过正常的身份认证机制，以 root 权限直接登录目标系统，实现权限提升。该漏洞源于程序未对命令行参数进行有效过滤和消毒，攻击者无需知道目标用户密码即可获取系统最高控制权。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 3.2.5 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0113"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1994-05-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:36Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 IBM AIX 至 4.1.0 及以上版本（该漏洞已在 AIX 4.x 中修复），或安装对应 APAR 补丁。同时禁用 rlogin/rsh/r-commands 系列服务（注释 /etc/inetd.conf 中相关行并重启 inetd），迁移至 OpenSSH 替代远程管理。限制 root 远程登录，在 /etc/securetty 中移除不必要的终端，并启用 PAM 认证机制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/458","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19348","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/297eb115816d3735806f02ee33bb4d2d53ecd5c6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0113.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0113","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0113.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0113.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0113.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/604.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/rlogin_froot.nasl","https://github.com/bailehang/snort_2.2.0/blob/34f8a3a85f15645aea53d6e0d46863c7c57e43ef/doc/signatures/609.txt","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/murahari1/recon-tool/blob/f63a205225373d0d87b081758c11899777970b0f/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0256.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1348","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1348.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1134","title":"HP Vue 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP Vue 3.0 图形用户界面环境存在权限提升漏洞，本地攻击者可通过利用 Vue 组件中的缺陷获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 HP 9.x 系列操作系统，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用，无需身份认证即可提权至超级用户。HP 已发布补丁 PHSS_4038、PHSS_4055 和 PHSS_4066 修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1134"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1994-05-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:47Z","remediation":"立即安装 HP 发布的补丁 PHSS_4038、PHSS_4055 和 PHSS_4066，升级 Vue 3.0 至修复版本。如无法打补丁，应限制本地用户对 Vue 程序的执行权限，移除不必要的 setuid 位，并禁用 guest 账户作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/e-23.shtml","http://packetstorm.securify.com/advisories/hpalert/008","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/2284.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aa3114da1227373bef7855dba21bcaa5f0e0ad76/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1134.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1134","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1134.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b4ddb28f94d250449ab64c1617f45b1f91701fa2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1134.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2339193e1c10dc2db330718adeb8cc8d88c4dd/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5rw3-h39w-p5j4/GHSA-5rw3-h39w-p5j4.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87952/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1134.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/112b6cf2eb30218e492a77c7d1bcb2220cd940b5/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1348.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1489","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1489.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1388","title":"Sun SunOS 4.1.x passwd 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"SunOS 4.1.x 系统中 passwd 命令存在符号链接漏洞，本地攻击者可通过 -F 命令行参数结合符号链接攻击，以 root 权限覆盖系统任意文件。该漏洞源于 passwd 在处理 -F 参数时未充分验证文件路径，使低权限用户可将 /etc/passwd 等关键文件替换为恶意内容，进而实现权限提升或系统破坏。攻击者需拥有本地账户权限，利用难度较低，影响 SunOS 4.1.x 全版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1388"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1994-05-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:19Z","remediation":"SunOS 4.1.x 已停止维护，官方不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级至受支持的 Solaris 10/11 操作系统。如无法升级，应严格限制本地用户登录权限，移除不可信用户的 shell 访问，并通过 auditd 监控 /etc/passwd 等关键文件的异常修改，同时避免将 passwd 命令授予非受信用户使用 -F 参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.dataguard.no/bugtraq/1994_4/0755.html","http://www2.dataguard.no/bugtraq/1994_2/0197.html","http://www2.dataguard.no/bugtraq/1994_2/0207.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b8e5ca8c68c148c2498e70421f33344e9cff1e8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1388.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1388","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1388.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/376d7933ee02aeea89711d9c7726aad7f10e0a2a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1388.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qjhq-gxx8-8fq8/GHSA-qjhq-gxx8-8fq8.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/1999.tsv","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1388.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--540e1e17-fd97-4418-a166-0e6922dd90b5.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1489.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1349","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1349.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1135","title":"HP-UX VUE 3.0 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP 9.x 操作系统中的 VUE 3.0（Visual User Environment）存在权限提升漏洞。本地用户可利用 VUE 环境的缺陷，通过特定操作绕过权限限制，成功利用后可获取 root 超级用户权限，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 HP 9.x 系列系统，CVSS v2 评分 7.2，危害等级高。HP 已发布补丁 PHSS_4994 和 PHSS_5438 修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1135"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1994-04-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:47Z","remediation":"应用 HP 官方补丁 PHSS_4994 和 PHSS_5438 修复 VUE 3.0 权限提升漏洞。建议升级 HP-UX 系统至包含该补丁的最新版本，并限制本地用户对 VUE 环境的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstorm.securify.com/advisories/hpalert/027","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2284"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1349.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0266","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0266.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0120","title":"Sun Solaris utmp 文件本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 操作系统中 utmp 文件存在权限配置不当漏洞。当该文件被设置为非 root 用户可写时，本地攻击者可修改 utmp 文件内容，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SunOS/Solaris 系统，需要攻击者拥有本地账户权限，攻击者可通过构造特制的 utmp 记录实现权限提升，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0120"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1994-03-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:37Z","remediation":"确保 utmp 文件仅 root 可写：执行 `chmod 644 /var/adm/utmp` 或 `chmod 644 /etc/utmp` 移除其他用户的写权限，同时 `chown root:root /var/adm/utmp` 确保文件属主为 root。升级到已修复此问题的 SunOS/Solaris 安全补丁版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/126"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0266.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0557","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0557.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0338","title":"IBM AIX 性能工具本地权限提升漏洞","description":"AIX 操作系统的许可软件产品性能工具存在权限提升漏洞，本地攻击者可利用该工具集的特权配置缺陷，通过执行特定命令获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 多个版本，攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限即可利用，无需用户交互。成功利用后攻击者可完全控制系统，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0338"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1994-02-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:11Z","remediation":"安装 IBM 针对该漏洞发布的 AIX APAR 补丁包，或升级至包含该修复的最新 AIX 维护级别（Maintenance Level）。临时缓解措施：以 root 用户执行 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/filemon /usr/bin/svmon /usr/bin/tprof` 移除受影响性能工具的 setuid 权限，并限制非授信用户对性能工具目录的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0338"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0557.toml"}]